#: store\templates\store\home.html
msgid "A curated collection of handcrafted sterling silver rings set with Yemeni agate, Nishapur turquoise, and Durr-e Najaf, alongside authentic Hirz scrolls of Imam Jawad (AS) and Abi Dujana scribed on deerskin with silver cases and hand-stitched leather armlets."
